Notes on `data/artifacts/`
--------------------------

Issue #38 / ADR-17 originally planned to vendor a small subset of
`Rootly-AI-Labs/logs-dataset` from Hugging Face under Apache-2.0.
At vendoring time (2026-04-25) that dataset was not publicly available
on Hugging Face (HTTP 404 on both the canonical and lower-cased repo
slugs). Loghub (`logpai/loghub`), the next canonical real-world log
corpus, ships under a research-only license that disallows
redistribution in this repository.

The `data/artifacts/` directory therefore contains
**internally-authored Praxis fixtures only**. See
`data/artifacts/NOTICE.md` for the full disclosure. No third-party data
is currently redistributed under this repository's MIT license.

When a properly-licensed real-world incident corpus becomes available,
this file will be updated to enumerate the source, license, vendoring
date, and local path; the corresponding fixtures under
`data/artifacts/` will be replaced or augmented; and the
`praxis_env.artifacts.ArtifactStore.PROVENANCE_PREFIX` will be updated
to reflect the upstream provenance.
